<title>USA: Winn-Dixie Stores Inc Q2 Jan 8 net falls.</title>
<headline>Winn-Dixie Stores Inc Q2 Jan 8 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSONVILLE, Fla. 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dollars in thousands except per share data</p>
<p>					    For the 16 Weeks Ended</p>
<p>				   January 8, 1997   January 10, 1996</p>
<p>				   Amount	 %	Amount	%</p>
<p> Sales		     $ 4,057,174  100.00  3,972,563  100.00</p>
<p> Gross profit		  989,319   24.38    946,312   23.82</p>
<p> Operating income	     45,927    1.13     83,612    2.10</p>
<p> Earnings before income taxes 74,511  1.84    111,477    2.80</p>
<p> Net earnings		   47,687    1.18     72,460    1.82</p>
<p> Earnings per share	     0.32		   0.48</p>
<p>					   Fiscal Year-to-Date</p>
<p>					 For the 28 Weeks Ended</p>
<p>				    January 8, 1997  January 10, 1996</p>
<p>				   Amount	 %	Amount	%</p>
<p> Sales		     $ 7,042,876  100.00  6,907,521  100.00</p>
<p> Gross profit		1,730,042   24.56  1,623,871   23.51</p>
<p> Operating income	     97,521    1.38    134,535    1.95</p>
<p> Interest expense	   (11,691)  (0.16)   (14,840)  (0.21)</p>
<p> Earnings before income taxes 148,000 2.10    182,057    2.64</p>
<p> Net earnings		   94,720    1.34    118,337    1.71</p>
<p> Earnings per share	     0.63		   0.78</p>
<p>NOTE: The consolidated financial statements include the accounts of Winn-Dixie Stores Inc and its subsidiaries which operate as a major food retailer in fourteen states and the Bahama Islands.</p>
<p>The company said it used 150,657,000 of weighted average number of shares of common stock in the current second quarter compared to 151,617,000 shares last year. For the year-to-date calculations, the company used 151,026,000 shares compared to 151,259,000 shares.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
